{"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSPasswordInput"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Password input is a UI element that allows to securely and confidentially capture a user’s password."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"As it is based on the "},{"code":"OUDSTextInput","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":",  it offers same layout and the same elements of configuration."}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSPasswordInput\/init(_:tableName:bundle:password:isHiddenPassword:placeholder:prefix:lockIcon:helperText:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:status:)-3qzfr","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSPasswordInput\/init(_:tableName:bundle:password:isHiddenPassword:placeholder:prefix:lockIcon:helperText:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:status:)-7dzud","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSPasswordInput\/init(_:tableName:bundle:password:isHiddenPassword:placeholder:prefix:lockIcon:helperText:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:status:)-7kbxc","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSPasswordInput\/init(label:password:isHiddenPassword:placeholder:prefix:lockIcon:helperText:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:status:)-5dhf0","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSPasswordInput\/init(label:password:isHiddenPassword:placeholder:prefix:lockIcon:helperText:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:status:)-6be66","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSPasswordInput\/init(label:password:isHiddenPassword:placeholder:prefix:lockIcon:helperText:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:status:)-8ufdf"],"title"